39
00:01:50,630 --> 00:01:51,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's this?</font>

40
00:01:52,210 --> 00:01:53,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where does this water...?</font>

41
00:02:29,870 --> 00:02:31,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the matter, Naruto?!</font>

42
00:02:32,210 --> 00:02:34,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Get ahold of yourself, please!</font>

43
00:02:41,590 --> 00:02:43,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

44
00:02:43,260 --> 00:02:46,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They all look like they're having fun.</font>

45
00:02:46,140 --> 00:02:48,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

46
00:02:49,940 --> 00:02:51,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

47
00:02:54,400 --> 00:02:56,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, you jerk...</font>

48
00:03:09,710 --> 00:03:11,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is that lake from before...</font>

49
00:03:13,920 --> 00:03:15,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

50
00:03:16,170 --> 00:03:17,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see.</font>

51
00:03:17,670 --> 00:03:21,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The person who was calling my name
earlier was you, right, Chishima?</font>

52
00:03:23,550 --> 00:03:25,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you hurt?</font>

53
00:03:25,140 --> 00:03:26,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I should be asking you that, Chishima.</font>

54
00:03:26,680 --> 00:03:28,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You shouldn't be moving
with that injury.</font>

55
00:03:28,520 --> 00:03:30,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm fine.</font>

56
00:03:31,520 --> 00:03:32,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">More importantly,
we need to find Lady Toki.</font>

57
00:03:32,900 --> 00:03:34,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, yeah, that's right.</font>

58
00:03:34,860 --> 00:03:37,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where the hell did that Moso go?</font>

59
00:03:38,610 --> 00:03:39,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm right here.</font>

60
00:03:41,490 --> 00:03:43,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Moso!
— Lady Toki!</font>

61
00:03:44,240 --> 00:03:49,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Chishima, I'm sorry for having
deceived you for so long...</font>

62
00:03:50,080 --> 00:03:54,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's all right, I already had
a sense that maybe...</font>

63
00:03:54,460 --> 00:03:57,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys know too many
of this land's secrets.</font>

64
00:03:58,210 --> 00:04:03,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll have you guys embrace those secrets
as you plunge headfirst into hell.</font>

65
00:04:11,980 --> 00:04:13,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that your real face?</font>

66
00:04:14,060 --> 00:04:16,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My name is Hoki.</font>

67
00:04:16,150 --> 00:04:17,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm a Wandering Ninja.</font>

68
00:04:17,860 --> 00:04:21,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not about to let you get in the way
of my taking this peaceful land,</font>

69
00:04:21,440 --> 00:04:23,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">which I have finally managed to snatch!</font>

70
00:04:23,650 --> 00:04:26,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Water Style: Water Dragon Jutsu!</font>

71
00:04:54,140 --> 00:04:55,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Chishima!</font>

72
00:04:55,730 --> 00:04:57,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Chishima!</font>

73
00:05:01,570 --> 00:05:02,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please, hang in there!</font>

74
00:05:04,950 --> 00:05:06,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you all right?</font>

75
00:05:07,530 --> 00:05:08,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm so relieved.</font>

76
00:05:08,950 --> 00:05:10,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Chishima!</font>

77
00:05:12,040 --> 00:05:13,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lady Toki...</font>

78
00:05:13,330 --> 00:05:15,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have fond memories...</font>

79
00:05:15,750 --> 00:05:19,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">of playing here at this lake...</font>

80
00:05:19,130 --> 00:05:22,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">with you and Lord Sagi.</font>

81
00:05:24,840 --> 00:05:26,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In those days,</font>

82
00:05:26,800 --> 00:05:31,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the Land of Bird was tranquil,
gentle and warm.</font>

83
00:05:32,430 --> 00:05:37,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Use your strength, Lady Toki...
to restore the Land of Birds...</font>

84
00:05:37,900 --> 00:05:40,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to the way it was in those days.</font>

85
00:05:42,020 --> 00:05:43,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Chishima.</font>

86
00:05:44,190 --> 00:05:45,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hang in there!</font>

87
00:05:46,740 --> 00:05:49,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, I beg you...</font>

88
00:05:50,240 --> 00:05:55,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">help Lady Toki... help my friend.</font>

89
00:05:55,710 --> 00:05:58,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sure thing.
If a Leaf Ninja promises something,</font>

90
00:05:58,250 --> 00:06:01,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he will complete it to the very end.</font>

91
00:06:02,420 --> 00:06:04,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Promise me.</font>

92
00:06:05,340 --> 00:06:10,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You must...
You must... protect Lady Toki.</font>

93
00:06:12,050 --> 00:06:14,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You have feelings for her, don't you?</font>

94
00:06:15,640 --> 00:06:19,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That ramen... was delicious.</font>

95
00:06:19,940 --> 00:06:22,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll treat you to some again.</font>

96
00:06:24,440 --> 00:06:29,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you... Naruto.</font>

97
00:06:34,410 --> 00:06:35,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Chishima!</font>

98
00:06:43,040 --> 00:06:44,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Chishima!</font>

99
00:06:47,720 --> 00:06:49,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Chishima!</font>

100
00:06:52,430 --> 00:06:54,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That guy was nothing more</font>

101
00:06:54,310 --> 00:06:57,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">than just another convenient servant,
after all.</font>

102
00:06:57,430 --> 00:06:58,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up!</font>

103
00:06:59,480 --> 00:07:03,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He loved the Land of Birds
with all his might.</font>

104
00:07:03,860 --> 00:07:07,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Chishima, who staked his life trying
to protect the country he loved.</font>

105
00:07:09,320 --> 00:07:14,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will not... forgive you,
no matter what!</font>

106
00:07:17,410 --> 00:07:19,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You may say
that you won't forgive me,</font>

107
00:07:19,250 --> 00:07:22,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but what exactly do
you think you can do?!</font>

108
00:07:23,210 --> 00:07:26,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Water Style: Giant Vortex Jutsu!</font>

109
00:07:34,930 --> 00:07:36,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Die!</font>

110
00:07:54,950 --> 00:07:56,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How annoyingly persistent!</font>

111
00:08:06,540 --> 00:08:07,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gentle Fist!</font>

112
00:08:16,180 --> 00:08:19,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was careless,
Copy Ninja Hatake Kakashi.</font>

113
00:08:19,810 --> 00:08:23,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The reputation of the Wandering Ninja
will be upgraded</font>

114
00:08:23,100 --> 00:08:26,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if I take you,
who possess the Sharingan, down.</font>

115
00:08:34,530 --> 00:08:36,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? A Substitution.</font>

116
00:08:37,200 --> 00:08:38,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry to disappoint you.</font>

117
00:08:39,120 --> 00:08:41,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't need to use the Sharingan
on the likes of you.</font>

118
00:08:48,000 --> 00:08:49,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— This way!
— Naruto!</font>

119
00:08:54,970 --> 00:08:56,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we follow this...</font>

120
00:08:56,260 --> 00:08:58,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, we should be able
to reach Naruto.</font>

121
00:09:07,480 --> 00:09:12,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Unfortunately, I cannot allow you
to avenge the blood of the fallen.</font>

122
00:09:12,190 --> 00:09:13,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The least I can do for you,
out of charity,</font>

123
00:09:13,900 --> 00:09:16,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is send you to the same place
your father and brother are.</font>

124
00:09:17,700 --> 00:09:18,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't care.</font>

125
00:09:20,490 --> 00:09:22,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why don't you just kill me
in one stroke?</font>

126
00:09:23,500 --> 00:09:25,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You know when to give up, huh?</font>

127
00:09:27,080 --> 00:09:32,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're all dead.
I'm the only one left in this world.</font>

128
00:09:35,300 --> 00:09:37,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now that I am unable to take revenge,</font>

129
00:09:37,840 --> 00:09:40,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have no more reason to live.</font>

130
00:09:40,430 --> 00:09:42,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're a courageous girl,
aren't you?</font>

131
00:09:42,810 --> 00:09:47,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right, I'll grant your wish.</font>

132
00:09:47,650 --> 00:09:49,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Resign yourself!</font>

133
00:10:02,910 --> 00:10:03,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wake up.</font>

134
00:10:10,330 --> 00:10:13,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Save Toki. Save my little sister.</font>

135
00:10:14,960 --> 00:10:18,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I entrusted the future
of the Land of Birds to my younger sister</font>

136
00:10:18,510 --> 00:10:19,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and gave her the watch.</font>

137
00:10:20,510 --> 00:10:24,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But Toki became obsessed
with her desire for revenge.</font>

138
00:10:25,020 --> 00:10:28,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I, a dead soul, cannot change
my younger sister's heart,</font>

139
00:10:28,230 --> 00:10:30,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">which is stalled in time.</font>

140
00:10:30,650 --> 00:10:32,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm begging you,</font>

141
00:10:32,110 --> 00:10:36,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">please make my younger sister's time
begin to move again towards the future.</font>

142
00:10:39,610 --> 00:10:41,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What was that just now?</font>

143
00:10:47,620 --> 00:10:48,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Die!</font>

144
00:10:52,750 --> 00:10:53,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

145
00:10:55,550 --> 00:10:57,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hold it!</font>

146
00:11:06,890 --> 00:11:07,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

147
00:11:09,690 --> 00:11:11,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hold it!</font>

148
00:11:21,160 --> 00:11:22,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

149
00:11:24,660 --> 00:11:27,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I met your elder brother
in a dream a little while ago.</font>

150
00:11:27,750 --> 00:11:28,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Elder Brother?</font>

151
00:11:30,290 --> 00:11:33,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It wasn't the wish
of your elder brother Sagi</font>

152
00:11:33,210 --> 00:11:34,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that you avenge his death.</font>

153
00:11:35,590 --> 00:11:38,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He wanted to leave the care
of this land in your hands.</font>

154
00:11:39,010 --> 00:11:41,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— But...
— For Chishima's sake, too,</font>

155
00:11:41,510 --> 00:11:44,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you must make
this Land of Bird a great country.</font>

156
00:11:47,430 --> 00:11:50,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why you must live, Toki.</font>

157
00:11:51,230 --> 00:11:52,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto.</font>

158
00:11:56,150 --> 00:11:58,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It doesn't make any difference to me.</font>

159
00:11:58,280 --> 00:12:01,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The two of you are going
to die here in any case.</font>

160
00:12:11,000 --> 00:12:14,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Hoki, you want this Land, right?</font>

161
00:12:14,920 --> 00:12:16,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What...?</font>

162
00:12:16,380 --> 00:12:20,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But a person with an impure heart,
with a heart bent on revenge,</font>

163
00:12:20,710 --> 00:12:22,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">cannot govern this land.</font>

164
00:12:24,180 --> 00:12:26,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The reason this was such
a wonderful country was because</font>

165
00:12:26,850 --> 00:12:31,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Chishima and Sagi and Toki's hearts
were all connected.</font>

166
00:12:32,140 --> 00:12:34,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if you use dirty tricks
to gain status,</font>

167
00:12:34,810 --> 00:12:37,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you will never be able to control
the hearts of the people.</font>

168
00:12:38,020 --> 00:12:39,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Speak for yourself, squirt!</font>

169
00:12:40,440 --> 00:12:42,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Multi Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

170
00:12:50,740 --> 00:12:52,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You Leaf Village greenhorn!</font>

171
00:12:53,000 --> 00:12:56,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll send you down into hell first
to meet up with the others!</font>

172
00:12:57,420 --> 00:13:00,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Multi Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

173
00:13:05,840 --> 00:13:08,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It ain't gonna be that easy!</font>

174
00:13:08,720 --> 00:13:12,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then try to spot the real one!</font>

175
00:13:12,560 --> 00:13:14,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What...?!</font>

176
00:13:14,810 --> 00:13:15,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go!</font>

177
00:13:36,500 --> 00:13:39,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn, which is the real one?</font>

178
00:13:52,810 --> 00:13:55,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, hang in there!</font>

179
00:13:56,640 --> 00:13:59,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wouldn't have thought the real one
would come straight out</font>

180
00:13:59,730 --> 00:14:01,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">when using Shadow Clones.</font>

181
00:14:01,400 --> 00:14:04,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was hoping
you'd let me have some fun.</font>

182
00:14:04,360 --> 00:14:06,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, that was your caliber, after all, huh?</font>

183
00:14:08,660 --> 00:14:11,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those without power should
hurry up and die!</font>

184
00:14:13,620 --> 00:14:17,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Better not underestimate me.
The battle is not yet won!</font>

185
00:14:21,590 --> 00:14:23,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You impertinent, little...!</font>

186
00:14:26,050 --> 00:14:27,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now!</font>

187
00:14:28,090 --> 00:14:30,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">U-zu-ma-ki...</font>

188
00:14:31,640 --> 00:14:32,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The real one is...</font>

189
00:14:33,010 --> 00:14:34,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">over here!</font>

190
00:14:34,470 --> 00:14:36,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto Barrage!</font>

191
00:14:44,320 --> 00:14:46,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— I did it!
— Chishima!</font>

192
00:14:51,110 --> 00:14:52,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Chishima...</font>

193
00:14:52,450 --> 00:14:54,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't die, Chishima!</font>

194
00:14:55,740 --> 00:14:59,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't... leave me... all alone!</font>

195
00:15:18,560 --> 00:15:19,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Open your eyes.</font>

196
00:15:21,100 --> 00:15:22,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please!</font>

197
00:15:40,830 --> 00:15:42,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lady Toki...</font>

198
00:15:44,540 --> 00:15:45,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Chishima!</font>

199
00:15:47,670 --> 00:15:48,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lady Toki.</font>

200
00:15:53,510 --> 00:15:54,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm so relieved!</font>

201
00:15:55,640 --> 00:15:57,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you, Naruto!</font>

202
00:15:58,720 --> 00:16:00,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was just carrying out my mission.</font>

203
00:16:00,980 --> 00:16:02,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">More importantly...</font>

204
00:16:04,150 --> 00:16:07,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">make that guy pay dearly
for his crimes, okay?</font>

205
00:16:08,280 --> 00:16:09,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes.</font>

206
00:16:10,240 --> 00:16:13,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sure that Sagi is happy
about this, too.</font>

207
00:16:13,990 --> 00:16:16,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You met...
You met Elder Brother Sagi...</font>

208
00:16:17,620 --> 00:16:20,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, in a dream.</font>

209
00:16:20,370 --> 00:16:22,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But even if it was in a dream,</font>

210
00:16:22,290 --> 00:16:24,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it doesn't change the fact
that he asked me to do something.</font>

211
00:16:24,710 --> 00:16:27,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What did Elder Brother say to you?</font>

212
00:16:27,210 --> 00:16:31,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, he said something
about starting up your time again.</font>

213
00:16:32,380 --> 00:16:33,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My time?</font>

214
00:16:34,510 --> 00:16:37,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He said he wanted you to forget
about things like revenge</font>

215
00:16:37,100 --> 00:16:39,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and instead live for the future.</font>

216
00:16:46,020 --> 00:16:47,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Elder Brother...</font>

217
00:16:47,980 --> 00:16:49,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey!</font>

218
00:16:50,110 --> 00:16:51,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

219
00:16:52,110 --> 00:16:55,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi-sensei, Neji, Tenten!</font>

220
00:17:06,540 --> 00:17:07,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Give me a break.</font>

221
00:17:07,580 --> 00:17:10,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't get paid my extra money
now that Moso,</font>

222
00:17:10,170 --> 00:17:12,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the guy who signs the paycheck,
got nabbed.</font>

223
00:17:12,590 --> 00:17:14,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Come on, resign yourself.
— But...</font>

224
00:17:15,010 --> 00:17:18,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It looks like the Wandering Ninja are
going to get a really stiff sentence.</font>

225
00:17:18,720 --> 00:17:23,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah. And Toki was finally able to break
the curse of seeking revenge.</font>

226
00:17:23,600 --> 00:17:25,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, it's gonna start!</font>

227
00:17:25,940 --> 00:17:29,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Down on your knees!</font>

228
00:17:37,950 --> 00:17:39,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wow.</font>

229
00:17:47,920 --> 00:17:50,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I must apologize
for having deceived everyone</font>

230
00:17:50,960 --> 00:17:52,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">by using my brother's name fraudulently</font>

231
00:17:52,750 --> 00:17:55,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and claiming the title of feudal lord.</font>

232
00:17:56,680 --> 00:17:58,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In a case such as this,</font>

233
00:17:58,050 --> 00:18:02,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it may well be proper to hand over
the title of feudal lord to someone else.</font>

234
00:18:02,850 --> 00:18:05,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, if you will forgive me,</font>

235
00:18:05,980 --> 00:18:07,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I would like to ask you
to allow me to work</font>

236
00:18:07,600 --> 00:18:09,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">on behalf of Land of Birds
as your lord.</font>

237
00:18:09,900 --> 00:18:13,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For my deceased father Owashi,
and brother Sagi...</font>

238
00:18:14,230 --> 00:18:19,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and for my dear friend Chishima,
who loves this country so dearly.</font>

239
00:18:19,870 --> 00:18:20,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lady Toki.</font>

240
00:18:22,370 --> 00:18:24,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As long as there is breath in my body,</font>

241
00:18:24,080 --> 00:18:26,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I would like to work positively
to rebuild this country.</font>

242
00:18:26,710 --> 00:18:29,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She's doing an excellent job, isn't she?</font>

243
00:18:29,080 --> 00:18:30,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Toki, awesome!</font>

244
00:18:31,710 --> 00:18:34,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As you wish, Lady Toki.</font>

245
00:18:35,090 --> 00:18:37,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It appears
that you all agree, too, correct?</font>

246
00:18:37,880 --> 00:18:39,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, sir!</font>

247
00:18:41,760 --> 00:18:43,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you...</font>

248
00:18:43,140 --> 00:18:47,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to Komei for accepting me
as your feudal lord, to everyone...</font>

249
00:18:47,980 --> 00:18:50,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And to the young Ninja who taught me</font>

250
00:18:50,650 --> 00:18:54,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">what it is that I should
really stake my life on.</font>

251
00:18:55,280 --> 00:18:57,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're embarrassing me.</font>

252
00:18:59,150 --> 00:19:01,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}"LAND OF BIRDS"</b></font>

253
00:19:01,740 --> 00:19:04,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please take the best of care
along the road now.</font>

254
00:19:04,910 --> 00:19:06,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fare thee well.</font>

255
00:19:06,120 --> 00:19:08,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Chishima, be nice to Toki, okay?</font>

256
00:19:09,370 --> 00:19:10,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you, Naruto.</font>

257
00:19:10,870 --> 00:19:14,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please come back to visit again soon.</font>

258
00:19:14,920 --> 00:19:18,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sure, next time I'd love to visit
without a mission.</font>

259
00:19:19,050 --> 00:19:20,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Goodbye.</font>

260
00:19:20,590 --> 00:19:22,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Goodbye. Be well.</font>

261
00:19:22,550 --> 00:19:23,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">See you.</font>

262
00:19:29,980 --> 00:19:34,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Toki, she was really kind
and gorgeous, too, wasn't she?</font>

263
00:19:34,810 --> 00:19:37,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm certain that the Land of Birds will
become a wonderful land again,</font>

264
00:19:37,230 --> 00:19:39,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— just like it was in the old days.
— Yeah.</font>

265
00:19:39,490 --> 00:19:42,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">By the way, Naruto,
did you really meet Sagi's ghost?</font>

266
00:19:42,860 --> 00:19:44,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You gotta be kidding.</font>

267
00:19:45,080 --> 00:19:48,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no such things as ghosts.
That was all in a dream.</font>

268
00:19:48,910 --> 00:19:51,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not so sure it was just a dream.</font>

269
00:19:51,670 --> 00:19:54,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the heck are you talking about?!</font>

270
00:19:54,540 --> 00:19:58,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you remember that Cursed Warrior
we cornered the very first time?</font>

271
00:19:59,340 --> 00:20:00,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uh, yeah.</font>

272
00:20:00,720 --> 00:20:02,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, he was empty inside.</font>

273
00:20:13,190 --> 00:20:15,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This...?</font>

274
00:20:17,360 --> 00:20:19,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The inside of it is empty.</font>

275
00:20:21,070 --> 00:20:24,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, but that was just
some sort of gimmick, right?</font>

276
00:20:24,200 --> 00:20:25,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Some kind of string or piece
of wire or something.</font>

277
00:20:25,660 --> 00:20:29,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, I definitely saw it with my Byakugan.</font>

278
00:20:29,200 --> 00:20:31,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now that you mention it,</font>

279
00:20:31,540 --> 00:20:34,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you said there was no sign of life,
right, Neji?</font>

280
00:20:35,330 --> 00:20:39,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, I didn't feel a speck of life
from that Cursed Warrior.</font>

281
00:20:39,670 --> 00:20:41,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words,
there was a ghost there.</font>

282
00:20:43,590 --> 00:20:46,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, that was a real ghost, after all?!</font>

283
00:20:47,010 --> 00:20:48,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Calm down, Naruto.</font>

284
00:20:48,560 --> 00:20:50,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's not true. That's not true!</font>

285
00:20:50,680 --> 00:20:54,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tell me that's not true!</font>

286
00:21:20,330 --> 00:21:23,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>kaze ga fuite aa</b></font></font></font>

287
00:21:20,330 --> 00:21:23,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>the wind blows</b></font></font></font>

288
00:21:23,060 --> 00:21:26,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>itai kienai omoi</b></font></font></font>

289
00:21:23,060 --> 00:21:26,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>the pain, the memories won't disappear</b></font></font></font>

290
00:21:26,730 --> 00:21:29,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>nani wo motte ikou ka</b></font></font></font>

291
00:21:26,730 --> 00:21:29,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>what should be brought along?</b></font></font></font>

292
00:21:29,480 --> 00:21:33,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>atsumete hitotsu</b></font></font></font>

293
00:21:29,480 --> 00:21:33,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>assemble them into a piece</b></font></font></font>

294
00:21:33,250 --> 00:21:36,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>nido to nai nido to nai</b></font></font></font>

